        <mxCell id="c7dFQTfO8ux_QdjiUAaL-111" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;basically, once it processing an mod/del event&lt;br&gt;it will update the complete event (ignore repeated&lt;br&gt;request)&lt;br&gt;- case recover, reset this to the last known good&lt;br&gt;processedIdand replay the same.&lt;br&gt;- if mid process, exception raise, will call recover&lt;br&gt;soft recover (remove faulty event) and processed id revert&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="c7dFQTfO8ux_QdjiUAaL-2" vertex="1">
