        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="RGcq7y0EKkY9ZN6DFWZF-47" value="The GateKeeper does not need to be idempotent, since if the DirtyFlag is on,&lt;br&gt;it is coded in away that it wont able to consume more event until it processed&lt;br&gt;and all the service emmit these event will only emiit once, until event notify that gate is free again" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="c7dFQTfO8ux_QdjiUAaL-2" vertex="1">
